    "body": ">Avoiding global variables is almost always a good thing\n\nIt's not that the variable is global, it's that it's an integer, which resets the PRNG to the same state every time. Instead of an integer, it should be a Generator object, which will be used directly without having its state reset. So it's more like, you should have a single Generator object that's initialized once globally and used everywhere.",
